{
    "title": "Western Union Send Money Now",
    "description": "Enjoy a $0 transfer fee* on your first transfer with Western Union\u00ae. <b>Send money</b> fast & safely to Mexico or globally from the US, available 24/7.\r\n\r\n<b>Send money</b>, track <b>money transfers</b>, <b>pay bills</b>, review <b>exchange rates</b> & find agent locations- all on the go with the Western Union \u00ae <b>money transfer app</b>.\r\n\r\nWE MOVE MONEY TO MORE THAN 200 COUNTRIES & TERRITORIES IN 130 CURRENCIES\r\nYour friends & loved ones can receive the funds directly to their bank account or mobile wallet** or pick up cash in their own currency at a convenient location near them.\r\n\r\nTOP-UP MOBILE NUMBERS\r\nWith us you not only can send money, you can even add money to mobile numbers all around the world.\r\n\r\nCONVENIENT PREPAID CARDS \r\nThe Western Union Prepaid Visa\u00ae Card offers low fees & convenience. Use for shopping wherever Visa Debit is accepted & get paid with Direct Deposit. \r\n\r\nSIMPLE CARD SCANNING   \r\nQuickly make a money transfer by setting up card payments on your mobile phone. Avoid mistakes by scanning your credit*** or debit card using the camera on your device.\r\n\r\nEASILY VIEW EXCHANGE RATES   \r\nView the latest international exchange rates instantly using the widget on our mobile money transfer app. See how the US dollar compares to other currencies on the move.\r\n\r\nQUICKLY REPEAT TRANSFERS   \r\nSave your receiver\u2019s details to your resend list & make repeat international money transfers fast & safely through the app.\r\n\r\nPAY BILLS ON THE GO\r\nFrom your car payment to a mortgage, pay bills anytime, anywhere, with our money transfer app.\r\n\r\nSTART ON THE MONEY TRANSFER APP, PAY IN CASH\r\nSave time at the counter by starting your money transfer on our app & paying in cash at a participating agent location. Visit one of more than 61,000**** across the US.\r\n\r\nPAY THE WAY THAT WORKS FOR YOU\r\nPay directly from your bank account, cash at an agent location, or with a credit***/debit card, & transfer in the currency of your choice.\r\n\r\nEASY TO SEND, SIMPLE TO RECEIVE\r\nUse the Western Union\u00ae app to send money & choose how your receiver will get the funds.\r\n\r\nBank account\r\n\u2022 Safely send money from your bank to billions of accounts worldwide.\r\nCash pickup\r\n\u2022 Transfer money with the app to thousands of cash pickup locations internationally.\r\nMobile wallet\r\n\u2022 You can send money directly to your recipient\u2019s mobile wallet** from one of our partners (in select countries), enabling them to access the funds in their currency.\r\n\r\nFEES & IMPORTANT DISCLOSURES\r\nWestern Union makes money from both transfer fees & currency exchange. When choosing a money transmitter, carefully compare the transfer fees & exchange rates. Fees, foreign exchange rates, & taxes may vary by brand, channel, & location based on a number of factors. Fees & rates are subject to change without notice. Please use care when providing commissary or bank account information. Funds will be paid into the account corresponding to your account number.\r\n\r\nServices may be provided by Western Union Financial Services, Inc. NMLS# 906983 &/or Western Union International Services, LLC NMLS# 906985. See terms and conditions for details.\r\n\r\nWestern Union has offices worldwide & is headquartered in Denver, 7001 E. Belleview, Denver, CO 80237.\r\n\r\nDo you have questions about our services? Contact one of our nearby Western Union agent locations. Use our agent location finder to find one nearby or call +1-720-332-1000.\r\n\r\n* Currency exchange commission applicable. Not available for credit cards & transfers to Cuba.\r\n\r\n** Money transfer to digital wallets is available for some international locations.\r\n\r\n*** A card-issuer cash advance fee & associated interest charges may apply if you use a credit card. To avoid these fees or for reduced fees, use a debit card or check other payment methods.\r\n\r\n**** Network data as of September 30, 2021.\r\n\r\nAdditional third-party charges may apply.",
